    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d509">

                <pb facs="1575" n="1417" sameAs="frus:frus1906p2/pg1417"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to Minister
                        Leishman</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1906-01-30"><hi rendition="#italic">January 30,
                        1906</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 996.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I inclose herewith, for your information
                    merely, a copy of a letter which I have addressed to Mr. Oscar S. Straus,
                    answering a letter from him to the President in which he expressed the hope that
                    the President may find it possible to exercise his good offices in behalf of the
                    oppressed people of Armenia.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Robert Bacon.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d509-a1.xml" xpointer="d509-a1"/>
            </div>
